{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_11\">Problem 11</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 11\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find a positive integral solution to the equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f8adec91c52f177a630818e67198e3c8563272a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+3+5+\\dots+(2n-1)}{2+4+6+\\dots+2n}=\\frac{115}{116}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"260\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/458609f2fd10e944f15a5d03ba470aa3d316df0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }110\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }115\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }116\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }231\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(E) }\\text{The equation has no positive integral solutions.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"377\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p>Notice that the numerator and denominator are the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> odd and even numbers, respectively. Then the numerator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/6006bba637eef443381fbaff768fa62d9ff41e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" />, and the denominator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfd81057d052a6e2d394c00239a5b63ad17a29a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(n+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/4/d84b2f8ca6b751b22e1c0d5912a9650ceb6df1ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{n+1} = \\frac{115}{116}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"100\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/78980059c5816a7d83740f8d2e08b4e13ccf89c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 115}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"109\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title